WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:10.315
My name is Travis Conrad

00:00:11.105 --> 00:00:13.515
I gave my entire life to the agency

00:00:14.445 --> 00:00:16.395
until they betrayed me

00:00:20.185 --> 00:00:21.325
They took my family

00:00:24.005 --> 00:00:25.305
They took my future

00:00:27.975 --> 00:00:30.215
They wouldn' t even let me die in peace

00:00:33.545 --> 00:00:34.340
What's happening to me?

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:35.000
You're gonna die

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.280
Again

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:40.820
How long do I have?

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:49.000
You have less than 24 hours to live

00:00:52.175 --> 00:00:54.025
Mr. Conrad

00:00:54.865 --> 00:00:56.455
finish one last job

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:58.600
and you'll live to see tomorrow

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:04.040
You have no idea what you've done

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.460
I'm gonna come at you with everything I've got

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:14.000
Send a strike team to find and kill

00:01:17.585 --> 00:01:18.785
Gonna have to get creative

00:01:21.015 --> 00:01:23.235
These guys don't play nice

00:01:25.235 --> 00:01:26.425
Neither do I

00:01:35.505 --> 00:01:36.505
We have nothing to lose

00:01:38.505 --> 00:01:40.505
He took my wife

00:01:41.575 --> 00:01:42.925
He took my son

00:01:46.775 --> 00:01:48.745
So you can either walk away

00:01:49.565 --> 00:01:51.645
or I'm gonna walk away over your dead body

00:01:58.305 --> 00:02:00.145
Send somebody back for the bodies

